  "description": "500W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi X3000max features front and rear dual-drive high-speed brushless motors. Compared to traditional motors, these reduce internal friction for more efficient performance. With a maximum torque of 95 Nm, the X3000max can easily tackle 40° inclines and conquer challenging terrain.\n\n48V 20Ah SAMSUNG Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi X3000max is powered by a 48V 20Ah Samsung Li-Ion battery built with 21700 cells, offering high capacity in a compact design. Its 960Wh battery provides safer, longer rides compared to other battery types, delivering up to 70 km in full electric mode and 130 km with pedal assist.\n\nFront Fork Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi X3000max features a full-suspension system, including hydraulic front forks with 120 mm of travel and an air shock absorber with a maximum pressure of 200 psi. This setup effectively absorbs impacts from rough terrain, providing a smooth, flat-road-like comfort and reducing rider fatigue.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
